<p class="lead">NewsArchive is an independent digital newsroom that publishes reporting on technology, world affairs, politics, business, education, sports, entertainment, health, the environment and science.</p>

<h2>What we do</h2>
<p>We publish news as it happens and keep every story in a searchable archive, so readers can follow a topic from the first report to the latest update.</p>

<h2>How our newsroom works</h2>
<p>Stories are written by our authors and reviewed by an editor before publication. Nothing written by an author appears on the site until an editor has approved it. Read our <a href="/editorial-policy">editorial policy</a> to learn more about how we report, review and correct stories.</p>

<h2>Get in touch</h2>
<p>Have a tip, a correction or feedback? Visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
